      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ARK SEA (6) set a new record time for fillies when leading and dominating her semi-final last week, her third win from as many starts this time in. That win added to a strong record at this circuit and distance and should have topped her off for this. She draws closer to the pegs and has the speed to take advantage of that so is the one to beat. Queensland visitor STRIPES (7) has been impossible to knock in putting five wins together, the last two coming in a heat and semi of this series, both at this circuit and distance. Would've helped her to have drawn inside ARK SEA but she is in terrific form. ONE MORE REASON (9) is a consistent filly who came from this barrier for second to ARK SEA last week and won from a similar draw prior. She can be in the finish along with EYE WISH (10) who draws wide but kept giving behind STRIPES last week and won two in a row prior.",
